## ⚡ Quick Daily Workflow Summary

1. Open Terminal in your project root (`c:\Users\gamin\Downloads\Roblox`).
2. Run `rojo serve` to connect local files to Roblox Studio.
3. Ask your AI Assistant to write features or fix bugs.
4. Save your progress: `git add .` -> `git commit -m "Feature complete!"`.
